{"id": "68777", "title": "宠爱一生", "author": "慕容侠", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 48, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68777.htm", "intro": "艾宠二十岁生日当天，母亲离家出走，留下个玉镯子让她自己去找亲爹。\r\n\r\n在zz大门埋伏了十个昼夜，艾宠终于见着她爹，并将其成功拿下。\r\n\r\n谁料到，认亲之后就是逼婚，面对一大把优质帅哥和成熟大叔，艾宠霸气侧漏，火力全开。\r\n\r\n常言说得好，一只羊也是赶，两只羊也是放，吃干抹净不留渣，方显女王本色。\r\n\r\n若能白首与共，宠爱一生又何妨？", "base": "files/article/html/68/68777", "chapters": [{"title": "第1章", "file": "10545616.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2章", "file": "10545617.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3章", "file": "10545618.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4章", "file": "10545619.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5章", "file": "10545620.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6章", "file": "10545621.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7章", "file": "10545622.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8章", "file": "10545623.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9章", "file": "10545624.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章", "file": "10545625.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章", "file": "10545626.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12章", "file": "10545627.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13章", "file": "10545628.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14章", "file": "10545629.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15章", "file": "10545630.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16章", "file": "10545631.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17章", "file": "10545632.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18章", "file": "10545633.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19章", "file": "10545634.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20章", "file": "10545635.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21章", "file": "10545636.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22章", "file": "10545637.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23章", "file": "10545638.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24章", "file": "10545639.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25章", "file": "10545640.html", "availa